# Copy file nay thanh "secrets.properties" (cung thu muc) roi dien key that.
# secrets.properties da nam trong .gitignore -> khong bi commit len git.
#
# Lay key TMDB mien phi:
#   1. Dang ky tai khoan: https://www.themoviedb.org/signup
#   2. Vao https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api -> tao API key (chon Developer, dien thong tin co ban)
#   3. Copy "API Key" (chuoi ngan) hoac "API Read Access Token" (chuoi dai bat dau bang eyJ) -> ca 2 deu dung duoc
tmdb.api-key=
